    "title": "KBI: Purple Alert for missing Kansas woman canceled - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Yates Center\nKBI: Purple Alert for missing Kansas woman canceled\n12 hours ago\nWOODSON COUNTY – The Yates Center Police Department reported to the Kansas Bureau of Investigation (KBI) that Tammara Isaacs was located safely. The statewide Purple Alert is canceled. A Purple Alert is used to assist in the location of missing adults suffering from a mental or cognitive disability. -----------",
